    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 8.4,
    "source_tts_end": 11.9
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "slide": 9,
    "start": 130.962628,
    "end": 133.096363,
    "text": "和实际耗时分开评价。",
    "estimated_width_px": 560.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 12.0125,
    "source_tts_end": 14.025
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "slide": 10,
    "start": 133.483322,
    "end": 134.793609,
    "text": "同一道三跳题，",
    "estimated_width_px": 392.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 0.1,
    "source_tts_end": 1.275
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "slide": 10,
    "start": 135.019607,
    "end": 138.062824,
    "text": "混合方法四次扩展就找到有效路径。",
    "estimated_width_px": 896.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 1.6625,
    "source_tts_end": 4.6
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "slide": 10,
    "start": 138.473177,
    "end": 141.246007,
    "text": "广度优先搜索用完八次预算时，",
    "estimated_width_px": 784.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 5.175,
    "source_tts_end": 7.8375
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "slide": 10,
    "start": 141.422844,
    "end": 143.765515,
    "text": "目标虽已生成，却尚未出队。",
    "estimated_width_px": 728.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 8.175,
    "source_tts_end": 10.4
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "slide": 10,
    "start": 144.175868,
    "end": 146.948698,
    "text": "这是预算失败，不是图中无解。",
    "estimated_width_px": 784.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 10.975,
    "source_tts_end": 13.6375
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "slide": 11,
    "start": 147.283322,
    "end": 148.876285,
    "text": "失败可以分成三类：",
    "estimated_width_px": 504.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 0.1,
    "source_tts_end": 1.5625
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "slide": 11,
    "start": 149.040833,
    "end": 153.091852,
    "text": "预算不足、遗传排序退化，以及专家规则关闭。",
    "estimated_width_px": 1176.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 1.8875,
    "source_tts_end": 5.85
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "slide": 11,
    "start": 153.502205,
    "end": 155.242651,
    "text": "有些增加预算就能恢复；",
    "estimated_width_px": 616.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 6.425,
    "source_tts_end": 8.0375
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "slide": 11,
    "start": 155.394908,
    "end": 158.462705,
    "text": "但证据未核验或已经失效的路径，",
    "estimated_width_px": 840.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 8.35,
    "source_tts_end": 11.3125
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "slide": 11,
    "start": 158.639543,
    "end": 161.436953,
    "text": "即使到达终点，也不能作为有效答案。",
    "estimated_width_px": 952.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 11.65,
    "source_tts_end": 14.3375
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "slide": 12,
    "start": 161.816656,
    "end": 165.990578,
    "text": "大模型负责合法性辅助、路径评分与核验后解释。",
    "estimated_width_px": 1232.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 0.1,
    "source_tts_end": 4.1875
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "slide": 12,
    "start": 166.400931,
    "end": 169.542469,
    "text": "新增十八题中，三组都全部成功，",
    "estimated_width_px": 840.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 4.7625,
    "source_tts_end": 7.8
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "slide": 12,
    "start": 169.719307,
    "end": 172.651911,
    "text": "总扩展均为七十八次，没有搜索增益。",
    "estimated_width_px": 952.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 8.1375,
    "source_tts_end": 10.9625
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "slide": 12,
    "start": 173.062264,
    "end": 176.289834,
    "text": "分类头减少误放行，却增加误拒绝；",
    "estimated_width_px": 896.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 11.5375,
    "source_tts_end": 14.6625
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "slide": 12,
    "start": 176.454381,
    "end": 179.841725,
    "text": "自由解释仍可能失真，不能替代证据核验。",
    "estimated_width_px": 1064.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 14.9875,
    "source_tts_end": 18.275
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "slide": 13,
    "start": 180.183322,
    "end": 182.132703,
    "text": "迁移到证明和规划时，",
    "estimated_width_px": 560.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 0.1,
    "source_tts_end": 1.925
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "slide": 13,
    "start": 182.28496,
    "end": 185.930401,
    "text": "必须重新定义状态、动作、终止和成本。",
    "estimated_width_px": 1008.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 2.2375,
    "source_tts_end": 5.7875
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "slide": 13,
    "start": 186.340753,
    "end": 188.695714,
    "text": "证明需保留所有未闭合目标，",
    "estimated_width_px": 728.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 6.3625,
    "source_tts_end": 8.6
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "slide": 13,
    "start": 188.872552,
    "end": 191.239802,
    "text": "规划需保留事实与资源；",
    "estimated_width_px": 616.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 8.9375,
    "source_tts_end": 11.1875
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "slide": 13,
    "start": 191.40435,
    "end": 193.488924,
    "text": "再用独立验证器核查结果。",
    "estimated_width_px": 672.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 11.5125,
    "source_tts_end": 13.475
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "slide": 14,
    "start": 193.849989,
    "end": 197.065269,
    "text": "等式样例通过传递和对称完成证明；",
    "estimated_width_px": 896.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 0.1,
    "source_tts_end": 3.2125
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "slide": 14,
    "start": 197.291268,
    "end": 200.113259,
    "text": "三积木样例用四步完成堆叠。",
    "estimated_width_px": 728.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 3.6,
    "source_tts_end": 6.3125
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "slide": 14,
    "start": 200.523612,
    "end": 203.689731,
    "text": "两个正例通过，八个错误分支被拒绝。",
