    "index": 74,
    "slide": 14,
    "start": 206.250883,
    "end": 208.544392,
    "text": "没有运行通用形式证明内核。",
    "estimated_width_px": 728.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 12.7125,
    "source_tts_end": 14.8875
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "slide": 15,
    "start": 208.916656,
    "end": 213.299513,
    "text": "后续评估关注完成率、总成本、解质量和泛化，",
    "estimated_width_px": 1176.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 0.1,
    "source_tts_end": 4.4
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "slide": 15,
    "start": 213.525511,
    "end": 216.888275,
    "text": "同时保留未知、非法结果和工具错误。",
    "estimated_width_px": 952.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 4.7875,
    "source_tts_end": 8.05
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "slide": 15,
    "start": 217.298628,
    "end": 219.039074,
    "text": "先接入可信验证器，",
    "estimated_width_px": 504.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 8.625,
    "source_tts_end": 10.2375
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "slide": 15,
    "start": 219.179041,
    "end": 221.767517,
    "text": "再用隔离任务集检验迁移收益。",
    "estimated_width_px": 784.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Light",
    "source_tts_start": 10.5375,
    "source_tts_end": 13.0125
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "slide": 16,
    "start": 222.116656,
    "end": 225.442548,
    "text": "最后总结：启发排序改善预算内搜索，",
    "estimated_width_px": 952.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Dark",
    "source_tts_start": 0.1,
    "source_tts_end": 3.325
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "slide": 16,
    "start": 225.631676,
    "end": 228.822376,
    "text": "但遗传优化和大模型不保证普遍收益。",
    "estimated_width_px": 952.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Dark",
    "source_tts_start": 3.675,
    "source_tts_end": 6.7625
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "slide": 16,
    "start": 229.232729,
    "end": 230.837982,
    "text": "系统始终坚持，",
    "estimated_width_px": 392.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Dark",
    "source_tts_start": 7.3375,
    "source_tts_end": 8.8125
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "slide": 16,
    "start": 230.904207,
    "end": 232.829008,
    "text": "用真实关系生成路径，",
    "estimated_width_px": 560.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Dark",
    "source_tts_start": 9.0375,
    "source_tts_end": 10.8375
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "slide": 16,
    "start": 232.907523,
    "end": 234.807743,
    "text": "用可核验证据解释结果。",
    "estimated_width_px": 616.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Dark",
    "source_tts_start": 11.075,
    "source_tts_end": 12.85
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "slide": 17,
    "start": 235.215,
    "end": 236.62,
    "text": "我们的汇报到此结束，",
    "estimated_width_px": 560.0,
    "position": [
      1280,
      1354
    ],
    "font": "Microsoft YaHei",
    "font_size": 56,
    "style": "Dark",
    "source_tts_start": 0.1,
    "source_tts_end": 1.35
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "slide": 17,
    "start": 236.865,
    "end": 237.9075,
    "text": "谢谢各位老师。",
    "estimated_width_px": 392.0,
